(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "数秒后听到了沉重的声音。\n又听到了像是什么人的悲鸣一般的声音。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00061",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "在我下楼的时候，伴随着看热闹人的喧嚣，\n不知是救护车还是巡逻车的警铃声也传到了耳中。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00062",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "在红色积水中央趴着的大叔。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00063",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "与2分钟前跟我说话时不同，他的手脚向着平常见不到的方向弯折着。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00064",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……即使没有医学上的知识也能明白。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00065",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "当场死亡。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00066",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "与其说是人，不如说曾经是人的东西，\n变成了应该被称为物体的模样。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00067",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "格子花纹的领带，\n也变成了鲜红的简约式样。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00068",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……就这样，自称不死身的大叔死了。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00069",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "「死亡被摆在眼前的话，谁都会说些意义不明的话吧……」",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00070",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "如此低语着，我离开了那里。",
